  "body": "Opening this to track the discussions in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1478#issuecomment-231225499 so I don't forget. We'll want to add some links to the Bugzilla bugs @bzbarsky referenced explaining what's going on here and stating something like \"as of 2011, this was necessary; if anyone using a Gecko UA string has evidence that it is not, let us know.\"\n\nWe could still make XMLDocument === Document (see https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/278) and just add `load` to Document, I believe.\n",
